@startuml Email_Workflow_Sequence_Flow
!theme aws-orange
title Invoice Email Workflow - Complete Flow Diagram

actor "Invoice Editor" as Editor
participant "Frontend UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
participant "Email Service" as EmailSvc
participant "Database Service" as DBSvc
participant "JWT Manager" as JWT
participant "SendGrid" as SG
participant "SMTP (Fallback)" as SMTP
participant "Supabase DB" as DB
actor "Bau-Leiter" as BauLeiter

== Phase 1: Invoice Editing & Editor Notification ==

Editor -> UI : Edit Invoice Fields
UI -> API : PUT /api/invoices/{id}
API -> DBSvc : Update Invoice Data
DBSvc -> DB : UPDATE invoices SET...
DB --> DBSvc : Success Response
DBSvc --> API : Invoice Updated

note over API
  **Trigger Email Workflow**
  After successful invoice update
end note

API -> EmailSvc : send_editor_notification()
activate EmailSvc

EmailSvc -> EmailSvc : Generate HTML Template
note right
  **Template Data:**
  - Invoice Details
  - Changes Summary
  - Editor Information
  - Timestamps
end note

EmailSvc -> JWT : generate_audit_token()
JWT -> JWT : Create Secure Token
JWT --> EmailSvc : Audit Token

EmailSvc -> DBSvc : Log Email Attempt
DBSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO email_audit_logs
DB --> DBSvc : Log ID

EmailSvc -> SG : Send via SendGrid API
alt SendGrid Success
    SG --> EmailSvc : 200 OK + Message ID
    EmailSvc -> DBSvc : Update Log (SUCCESS)
    EmailSvc --> API : {success: true, provider: "sendgrid"}
else SendGrid Fails
    SG --> EmailSvc : Error Response
    note over EmailSvc : **Automatic Fallback**
    EmailSvc -> SMTP : Send via SMTP
    alt SMTP Success
        SMTP --> EmailSvc : SMTP Success
        EmailSvc -> DBSvc : Update Log (SUCCESS via SMTP)
        EmailSvc --> API : {success: true, provider: "smtp"}
    else SMTP Also Fails
        SMTP --> EmailSvc : SMTP Error
        EmailSvc -> DBSvc : Update Log (FAILED)
        EmailSvc --> API : {success: false, error: "Both providers failed"}
    end
end

deactivate EmailSvc

API -> DBSvc : Update Invoice Status
DBSvc -> DB : UPDATE invoices SET status='completed'
API --> UI : Email Sent Confirmation
UI --> Editor : "✅ Email Sent Successfully"

== Phase 2: Bau-Leiter Approval (Future Implementation) ==

note over EmailSvc, BauLeiter
  **Future Phase 2:**
  Automatic progression to approval workflow
  with secure approval links
end note

EmailSvc -> EmailSvc : Generate Approval Email
EmailSvc -> JWT : generate_approval_token()
JWT --> EmailSvc : Secure Approval URLs

EmailSvc -> SG : Send Approval Email
SG --> BauLeiter : 📧 Approval Email with Secure Links

BauLeiter -> EmailSvc : Click Approve/Reject Link
EmailSvc -> JWT : Validate Token
JWT --> EmailSvc : Token Valid
EmailSvc -> DBSvc : Record Approval Decision
EmailSvc --> BauLeiter : "✅ Decision Recorded"

== Security & Audit Trail ==

note over DB
  **Complete Audit Trail:**
  - All email attempts logged
  - Security tokens tracked
  - Approval decisions recorded
  - Timestamps for everything
  - Error details captured
end note

@enduml
